WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.500
Step 2 is the first scheduled run.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.184
It runs every check and the metrics
into a folder for the month,

3
00:00:06.184 --> 00:00:10.374
records each one in the stage's
evidence folder with the change record,

4
00:00:10.374 --> 00:00:12.975
and writes a scheduled-run
record of its own.

5
00:00:12.975 --> 00:00:15.073
In fixture mode, most checks fail,

6
00:00:15.073 --> 00:00:19.037
because the fixtures carry each
chapter's deliberate faults.

7
00:00:19.037 --> 00:00:23.968
In a test tenant, each failure is a
list of findings in its run folder:

8
00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:26.926
tickets, plan corrections, role changes.

9
00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:29.300
Close them before the go or no-go.
